    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
This class inherits from :cpp:class:`IfTemplateTree`

A variation of :cpp:class:`IfTemplateTree` such that leaf nodes that do not have any parts
(eg. empty conditions) will include an empty #ContentPart placeholder -- the C++ port of
``IfTemplateTree.py``&apos;s ``IfTemplateNonEmptyNodeTree`` class :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

.. tip::
   See :cpp:class:`IfTemplateTree` on the basic structure of the parse tree
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>K</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the keys stored in a referenced :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_if_content_part" kindref="compound">IfContentPart</ref></computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>V</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the values stored in a referenced :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_if_content_part" kindref="compound">IfContentPart</ref></computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>KeyHash</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A hasher for <computeroutput>K</computeroutput>, same meaning as :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_if_content_part" kindref="compound">IfContentPart</ref></computeroutput>&apos;s own <computeroutput>KeyHash</computeroutput>. Defaults to <computeroutput>std::hash&lt;K&gt;</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>KeyEqual</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>An equality comparator for <computeroutput>K</computeroutput>, same meaning as :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_if_content_part" kindref="compound">IfContentPart</ref></computeroutput>&apos;s own <computeroutput>KeyEqual</computeroutput>. Defaults to <computeroutput>std::equal_to&lt;K&gt;</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
